# A teleport onto a parked car (commands.ts teleport; a report from Washington
# Square). The point given, 951 3412 10.3, is 1.2 m under the car's roof (11.5) and 0.3 m over the road:
# the skater used to land on the road inside the car's body, creep out through its side, and draw inside
# the car (a clip looked like a fall through the ground; Node and Chromium agreed all along). Below the
# top of a body, seen as an up-facing surface straight above within 4 m, a teleport now goes on top of
# it: onto the hood box (11.02), then the cabin roof (11.5). The skater lands there and stays put.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 11 712 4.3
run 480
expect event teleport within 1..3
expect state ground at 30
expect skater.pos.z > 5.55 at 30
expect skater.pos.z > 5.55 at end
expect max skater.pos.y < 712.2
expect skater.speed < 0.1 at end
expect no event bail
